t's a waste of time?","nextNodeIds":[200230105]},{"nodeId":200230105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":2676289065,"text":"Take Nimrod for instance. He has come here to confess his alcohol abuse numerous times, but he hasn't changed one bit...","nextNodeIds":[200230106]},{"nodeId":200230106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":101792129,"text":"If you have time, maybe you could go and check up on him?","nextNodeIds":[200230107,200230110]},{"nodeId":200230107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2228231313,"text":"Okay.","nextNodeIds":[200230108]},{"nodeId":200230108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":1871046889,"text":"Oh — and if he is drinking again, please bring some evidence back.","nextNodeIds":[200230109]},{"nodeId":200230109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":1551209361,"text":"Sometimes, serial offenders need a little instruction to help them correct the error of their ways...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200230110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1359590449,"text":"Is drinking a sin, then?","nextNodeIds":[200230111]},{"nodeId":200230111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":3678013353,"text":"Drinking alone is not a sin. But it is sinful to drink to the point that you bring undue distress to others.","nextNodeIds":[200230112]},{"nodeId":200230112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":3093686537,"text":"If everyone was to behave quite so unscrupulously, sooner or later the entirety of Mondstadt would find itself in a very distressing situation.","nextNodeIds":[200230113]},{"nodeId":200230113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":147101,"speakerName":"Victoria","textMapHash":1599281,"text":"So each time a sin rears its ugly head, it needs to be nipped in the bud. Now, quickly, go check up on Nimrod for me.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2002301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["147101"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2002302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Find Nimrod","stepDescTextMapHash":1240909480,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2002302,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["146101"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1009,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[2002302,2002305],"talks":[{"talkId":2002302,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"partici